Output demo.mp4
Set FontFamily "JetBrainsMono Nerd Font"
Set FontSize 18
Set Theme "GitHub Dark"
Set Padding 10
Set Width 1000
Set Height 800
Set Shell bash

Type './tagselecta ui ./Album'

Enter
Sleep 2s

Tab
Sleep 2s

Type k
Sleep 2s

Type ":edit artist=Cantti genre=Reggae"
Sleep 4s

Enter
Sleep 4s

Type ":write"
Sleep 2s

Enter
Sleep 4s
